# ==================================================================
# Docker 构建上下文白名单：只复制 daily_mailer.py / elk_p99_report.py / 依赖
# 这样把报表/邮件/日志/ZIP/临时脚本等统统挡在镜像外，减少体积+防敏感泄露
# ==================================================================

# --- 演示产物（绝对不能进镜像，体积大+含客户邮件/数据）---
_demo_received_emails/
reports/
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.Python

# --- 打包交付物（ZIP、NDJSON、CONF）---
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
kibana_dashboard_*.ndjson
logstash_pipeline_*.conf

# --- 本机配置（含真实 ES/SMTP 密码，严禁进镜像）---
config_daily_report.json
config_daily_report_LOCAL_DEMO.json
config_daily_report_TESTENV.json

# 只允许 example 模板进镜像（构建断言用）
!config_daily_report.example.json

# --- 本机脚本（计划任务、wrapper.bat 仅宿主机用，容器不跑 schtasks/cron 容器只单次执行）---
install_daily_report_WINDOWS.bat
install_daily_report_cron_LINUX.sh
install_daily_report_macos.sh
uninstall_daily_report_WINDOWS.bat
run_daily_mailer_wrapper.bat
run_local_demo_WINDOWS.bat
mock_local_smtp_server.py
_demo_launcher.py
_tmp_*.py
_docker_build*.ps1
test_*.py
mock_smtp_verify.py

# --- IDE / OS 垃圾 ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.git/
.github/
node_modules/
